<title>USA: Worldtex stake raised by group to 7.4 pct.</title>
<headline>Worldtex stake raised by group to 7.4 pct.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-04-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>A group of New York investors said Friday it raised its stake in Worldtex Inc to 7.4 percent or 825,699 shares.</p>
<p>In a filing with the U.S. Securities and Exchange Commission, the group, which includes EGS Associates LP, BEV Partners LP and Jonas Partners LP, said it most recently acquired more than 200,000 shares between Jan 28 and April 10 at $6.49 to $9.70 each.</p>
</text>
